WEBVTT

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:09.980
As I thought, big brothers sure have a respectable role.

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:28.180
This is bad!

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:30.360
It got wet!

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.520
Well, I guess I'll wash them as well.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:11.890
Great!

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.410
One, two, sangaria…

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.700
Two, two, sangaria…

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.880
Sangaria and…

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.080
It would have been better if I hadn't washed these.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:33.540
Oh man...

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:44.030
It's hot!

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:45.900
I'm tired!

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:55.900
That's refreshing...

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:19.310
It's hot!

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:07.610
Whoopee!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:17.090
Ah, what a great feeling~

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:34.710
Heavy rain all of a sudden...

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.150
Darn it!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.420
Ah man!

00:05:54.860 --> 00:05:56.250
It's getting wet!

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:07.870
It's all soaked. I'll have to do the washing again,

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:09.580
in spite of everything.

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:18.610
Eh? Wait a minute...!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:25.370
What's up with this! Jeez...

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:30.990
One, two, sangaria!

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:33.450
Hey, the master has returned home!

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:34.990
Greet me while I'm doing so!

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.540
What are you saying, idiot!

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:40.420
I'm in a terrible mood right now!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:41.460
Oh?

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:42.360
Heh heh...

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:43.610
What is it?

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:46.460
If you're trying to seduce me, why don't you do it at a better time?

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:51.360
Even I won't be able to wake up during the bright hours of the day.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.600
No!!!!!!!!!!!

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:01.030
Idiot!

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:02.810
What are you doing?!

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:05.360
Get out! Get out! Get out!

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.570
Idiot, why are you making such a racket?

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.010
This is my house, isn't it?

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:11.580
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:12.960
What the heck?!

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:15.410
Gosh, don't look!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.850
What did I do?

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:17.760
Get lost!

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:24.150
Akikan!

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:42.930
Budoko, I'll be going shopping...

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.130
Have a good nap, Budoko.

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.780
It's a new technique!

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:20.990
Check it out!

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:46.630
Grape!

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:50.720
How's that?

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:53.430
Have you acknowledged my strength yet?

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.290
Wait, steel can!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:49.810
I said wait there!

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:54.220
That Melon, take this!

00:09:57.100 --> 00:10:00.300
Misaki, let's play!

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.130
Misaki?

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.300
She's not here...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.380
I'm going out shopping.

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:33.430
There's juice in the fridge.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.320
Ju, ju...

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:59.330
Why!!!!!!!!!!!!

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:01.700
What happened?

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:04.130
I was only taking an afternoon nap!

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:08.640
It can't be...!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:10.700
That steel can...?!

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.150
To attack someone during their sleep.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.420
That's low!

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:17.580
Come out now!

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:19.980
It's useless to hide!

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:25.830
Give me a break!

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:31.500
Though Misaki's the one who usually does this for me...

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.860
I look like a princess!

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.410
Ah, that's right!

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:18.290
Perfect!

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:22.580
With this, I'll be seen as a princess no matter how you look at it!

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:24.900
Now, Cinderella!

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.150
Take care at the castle!

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:29.020
Thank you, Fairy Godmother!

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:33.560
Yippee!

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:35.930
I'm taking a ride in a pumpkin carriage to the castle!

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:45.350
Tonight is the ball, right?

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:49.880
Isn't it fun, Prince?

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:57.880
My eyes are spinning.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:06.820
You stay here.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:12.680
You stay here, number three.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:14.020
Number four.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:15.230
Number five.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:16.690
Number six.

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:18.940
And number seven.

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:26.160
This looks like Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs!

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:30.340
I wonder if Misaki will be coming back soon?

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:34.600
She'll probably be surprised when she finds out I've turned into a princess!

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:44.840
One, two, sangaria.

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:47.660
Two, two, sangaria.

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.670
Budoko, I've bought a souvenir for you.

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:01.780
Misaki...

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:06.740
I'm back, Budoko.

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:17.340
Akikan!

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:20.960
Akikan!

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:28.350
I'll be going then, Yell!

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:30.460
Take care, Owner!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:27.980
MEOW!

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:27.610
One, two, sangaria.

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:30.260
Two, two, sangaria.

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:33.360
Sangaria, sangaria, haha!

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:35.720
Yell, I'm home!

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:39.000
Welcome home, Owner.

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:17.120
It has arrived at last!

00:23:17.690 --> 00:23:20.590
It's my turning out to be the strongest Akikan...

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:22.370
...That's not it?

00:23:22.980 --> 00:23:25.070
Eh? You're the strongest?

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:26.770
No!

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:28.570
Misaki!
